==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|es}} {{m|la|probāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|probō}}.

===Verb===
{{es-verb|prob|ar|pres=pruebo}}

# to [[prove]]
#:* ''No puedes probarlo.'' - 'You can’t prove it.'
# to [[taste]]
#:* ''Prueba a ver si está bueno.'' - 'Taste it to see if it’s good.'
# to [[try]]
#:* ''Lo probó todo sin éxito.'' - 'He tried everything without success.'
# {{label|es|reflexive}} (''with clothes and similar'') to see if it [[fit]]s; to try on
#:* ''María se probó el vestido.''

====Conjugation====
{{es-conj-ar (o-ue)|pr|b}}

====Related terms====
